msgstr ""

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:63
#: 84522a6c300d4a4287cf786f2d09783d
msgid ""
"**If you’re on Fedora**, you can get it in the `distribution-gpg-keys "
"<https://github.com/xsuchy/distribution-gpg-keys>`__ package:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:71
#: 727cfb4c498f43438df881b9ef79ffaf
msgid "**If you’re on Debian**, it may already be included in your keyring."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:73
